---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Flash — This Week's Top Picks"
description: "Mimajo's weekly Flash picks — the biggest discounts of the week, unlocked for Voyager and Globetrotter members."
permalink: "/flash.html"
---
{% from "partials/macros.njk" import flashCard %}

<section class="flash-hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow">⚡ Refreshed every Monday</span>
    <h1>This week's Flash picks</h1>
    <p>Our biggest discounts of the week, hand-picked — unlocked for Voyager and Globetrotter members.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="flash-band">
    <p>You're viewing Flash as an <strong>Explorer (free)</strong> member. Upgrade to Voyager to unlock this week's prices.</p>
    <a href="/membership.html" class="btn-unlock">See Membership Plans</a>
  </div>

  <div class="deal-grid" style="margin-top:32px;">
    {% for deal in flashDeals %}
      {{ flashCard(deal) }}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <p style="max-width:var(--maxw); margin:32px auto 0; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.85rem;">
    Flash prices are placeholder content for the site prototype. Real member-gating (unlocking prices only for logged-in Voyager/Globetrotter accounts) needs a login system, which is a later build phase — see the founder roadmap.
  </p>
</section>
